Android Open Source Project notice
==================================

The graphics sources are a bounded compatibility extraction for Scarlet.
gralloc.c, the mapper entry point, and the allocator and composer service
entry points are Scarlet source under the MIT license in LICENSE. Their
upstream interface definitions and the generated HWC2 framebuffer adapter
source are Android Open Source Project material.

The build pins and verifies these official upstream sources:

  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/libhardware/
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/interfaces/
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/prebuilts/vndk/

The exact repository, revision, and path for each pinned tree or file are in
adapter-headers.json and headers.json. Those files retain their upstream
copyright and license notices when downloaded. AOSP source is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The HWC2OnFbAdapter source is transformed in the build directory to preserve
the validated dynamic display behavior; the downloaded header cache is not
modified.
